    <li>
      Use the cross-partial property to show that a vector field is conservative.
    </li>
    <li>
      Find the potential function and use it to compute a line integral.
    </li>
    <li>
      Compute the flux of a vector field across a curve.
    </li>
    <li>
      Calculate the circulation of a vector field.
    </li>
  </ul>
</objectives>
